#: ../../library/dht.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`dht` --- DHT11 and DHT22 temperature/humidity sensors"
msgstr ":mod:`dht` --- DHT11- och DHT22-temperatur-/fuktighetssensorer"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`dht` module provides drivers for the DHT11 and DHT22 (also known "
"as AM2302) low-cost temperature and humidity sensors."
msgstr ""
"Modulen :mod:`dht` tillhandahåller drivrutiner för de billiga temperatur- "
"och fuktighetssensorerna DHT11 och DHT22 (även känd som AM2302)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:10
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Exempel::"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:20
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klasser"

#: ../../library/dht.rst:24
msgid ""
"Base class for DHT sensors. Not normally instantiated directly --- use "
":class:`DHT11` or :class:`DHT22` instead."
msgstr ""
"Basklass för DHT-sensorer. Instansieras normalt inte direkt --- använd "
":class:`DHT11` eller :class:`DHT22` istället."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:29
msgid ""
"Trigger a measurement on the sensor and read the 5-byte response into the "
"internal buffer. Raises :exc:`Exception` with the message ``\"checksum "
"error\"`` if the data checksum is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Utlöser en mätning på sensorn och läser in det 5-bytes svaret i den interna "
"bufferten. Genererar :exc:`Exception` med meddelandet ``\"checksum error\"``"
" om datakontrollsumman är ogiltig."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:33
msgid ""
"Call this method before reading :meth:`temperature` or :meth:`humidity`. The"
" DHT sensors require at least 1 second (DHT11) or 2 seconds (DHT22) between "
"consecutive measurements."
msgstr ""
"Anropa denna metod innan du läser :meth:`temperature` eller "
":meth:`humidity`\\ . DHT-sensorerna kräver minst 1 sekund (DHT11) eller 2 "
"sekunder (DHT22) mellan på varandra följande mätningar."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:39
msgid ""
"Driver for the DHT11 sensor. Connect the sensor's data line to *pin* (a "
":py:class:`machine.Pin`). The DHT11 reports integer values with 1 percent "
"relative humidity and 1 degree Celsius resolution."
msgstr ""
"Drivrutin för DHT11-sensorn. Anslut sensorns dataledning till *pin* (ett "
":py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ ). DHT11 rapporterar heltalsvärden med en "
"upplösning på 1 procent relativ fuktighet och 1 grad Celsius."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:45
msgid ""
"Return the relative humidity from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as "
"an integer percentage (0--100)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar den relativa fuktigheten från det senaste :meth:`measure`\\ "
"-anropet, som en heltalsprocent (0--100)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:50
msgid ""
"Return the temperature from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as an "
"integer in degrees Celsius."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar temperaturen från det senaste :meth:`measure`\\ -anropet, som ett"
" heltal i grader Celsius."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:55
msgid ""
"Driver for the DHT22 / AM2302 sensor. Connect the sensor's data line to "
"*pin* (a :py:class:`machine.Pin`). The DHT22 reports values with 0.1 percent"
" relative humidity and 0.1 degree Celsius resolution, and supports negative "
"temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Drivrutin för DHT22-/AM2302-sensorn. Anslut sensorns dataledning till *pin* "
"(ett :py:class:`machine.Pin`\\ ). DHT22 rapporterar värden med en upplösning"
" på 0,1 procent relativ fuktighet och 0,1 grad Celsius, och stöder negativa "
"temperaturer."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:62
msgid ""
"Return the relative humidity from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as a"
" ``float`` percentage (0.0--100.0)."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar den relativa fuktigheten från det senaste :meth:`measure`\\ "
"-anropet, som en ``float``\\ -procent (0.0--100.0)."

#: ../../library/dht.rst:67
msgid ""
"Return the temperature from the most recent :meth:`measure` call, as a "
"``float`` in degrees Celsius. Negative values are supported."
msgstr ""
"Returnerar temperaturen från det senaste :meth:`measure`\\ -anropet, som en "
"``float`` i grader Celsius. Negativa värden stöds."
